  "name": "Slowed speech in reverb",
  "desc": "Half-speed dirt-samples speech drowned in room and a long dub delay \u2014 the classic vaporwave slowed vocal drift. Sparse rotates one slurred word per cycle through the sample bank under a filter breath; full trades two words a bar panning slowly; peak chops and ply-stutters a dense drenched wash with a phrase-end fill. A voice remembered underwater.",
